     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Automation",
     "texto": [
      "**Artificial intelligence** can carry out or support certain tasks. A **productivity gain** means that a work process becomes more efficient, although the effect depends on how the technology is used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Working transition",
     "texto": [
      "When tasks change, employees may need continuing training or occupational retraining. The possible benefits should be weighed against the drawbacks."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
